# Decidim on Docker
On a daily basis, we publish images for three decidim versions, based on various distributions (default is `ubuntu:<%= ubuntu_tag %>`).
To start with decidim in a breeze, follow our [▶️ 5min tutorial](./5min-tutorial.md).

## Available tags
| Tag | Description |
| ---  | ---|
| `:latest` | Unstable `development` version. (alias for `<%= develop_version.decidim_version %>`) |
| `:<%= last_version.decidim_version %>` | Last version |
| `:<%= prev_version.decidim_version %>` | Stable version, security and bug fixes only |

